caption: Clearance Refinement
technology-rule: clearance-refinement

Clearance Refinement reduces residual clearance without changing effect duration, DPL, BV, or the addiction roll. Residual clearance begins when the beneficial effect ends.

R_Cl 0: ×300.

R_Cl 1: ×100.

R_Cl 2: ×30.

R_Cl 3: ×10.

R_Cl 4: ×3.

R_Cl 5: ×1.

R_Cl 6: ×0.3.

R_Cl 7: ×0.1.

Seven points is the hard cap. A formula cannot reduce residual clearance below 10% of its effective duration. If Clearance Refinement is omitted from an older formula record, treat it as R_Cl 0.
